    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> that exposes a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/JobDetail.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>JobDetail</code></a> object which delegates job execution to a\nspecified (static or non-static) method.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../../factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> 暴露一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.quartz-scheduler.org/api/2.3.0/org/quartz/JobDetail.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.quartz\"><code>JobDetail</code></a> 对象，该对象将作业执行委托给指定的（静态或非静态）方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Simple method invoker bean: just invoking a target method, not expecting a result\nto expose to the container (in contrast to <a href=\"../../factory/config/MethodInvokingFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>MethodInvokingFactoryBean</code></a>).",
      "translation": "简单的方法调用 Bean：仅调用目标方法，不期望将结果暴露给容器（与<a href=\"../../factory/config/MethodInvokingFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>MethodInvokingFactoryBean</code></a>形成对比）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../../factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> which returns a value which is the result of a static or instance\nmethod invocation.",
